      summary:
          'High-resolution satellite altimetry reveals geological features.',
      content:
          'A new satellite-based mapping effort has revealed thousands of previously unknown underwater mountains and ridges, helping scientists understand ocean currents and plate movement.',
      imageUrl: 'https://picsum.photos/seed/ocean/600/300',
    ),
    Article(
      id: 2,
      category: 'General',
      source: 'World Daily',
      readMins: 3,
      title: 'Cities Roll Out Free Public Wi-Fi Zones',
      summary: 'Several cities are expanding free internet access in parks.',
      content:
          'Local governments are installing free Wi-Fi in parks, libraries and bus stations to help students and small businesses get online.',
      imageUrl: 'https://picsum.photos/seed/city/600/300',
    ),
    Article(
      id: 3,
      category: 'Technology',
      source: 'Tech Weekly',
      readMins: 5,
      title: 'Flutter Adds Faster Rendering for Web Apps',
      summary: 'New engine updates cut startup time on low-end devices.',
      content:
          'The latest Flutter release improves web startup performance and reduces memory use, making apps feel smoother on budget phones and laptops.',
      imageUrl: 'https://picsum.photos/seed/flutter/600/300',
    ),
    Article(
      id: 4,
      category: 'Technology',
      source: 'Dev Today',
      readMins: 4,
      title: 'AI Coding Assistants Become Standard in Classrooms',
      summary: 'Students are learning to code with AI helpers.',
      content:
          'Colleges report that students who use AI tools alongside traditional teaching finish projects faster, as long as they still learn the fundamentals.',
      imageUrl: 'https://picsum.photos/seed/coding/600/300',
    ),
