      category: 'Science',
      source: 'Science Now',
      readMins: 6,
      title: 'Telescope Spots Water Vapor on Distant Planet',
      summary: 'Astronomers detect water in an exoplanet atmosphere.',
      content:
          'Using infrared observations, researchers found clear signs of water vapor around a planet 120 light-years away.',
      imageUrl: 'https://picsum.photos/seed/space/600/300',
